The class CosmosClusteringProviderBuilder is internal, so I cannot directly instantiate it in the test. Also, the builder methods expect specific builder interfaces from Orleans, not the mocks I created. I will instead write tests that use minimal mocks and verify the behavior by mocking the IServiceProvider and IConfiguration to verify the call to GetConnectionString. I will focus on the IServiceProvider and IConfiguration interaction to cover the call on line 55.

I will submit a simpler test that mocks IConfiguration and IServiceProvider and verifies that GetConnectionString is called with the expected connection name when the connection string is empty and connection name is provided.

